        "original_id": "7494e048-c174-500f-b36d-a70bd5baef2b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. Paul Boehmer, John McTiernan, Pierce Brosnan, Rene Russo, Denis Leary\n- Products: Star Trek, The Thomas Crown Affair, The Good German, Gregor and the Code of Claw audiobook\n- Topics: acting careers, film remakes, audiobook releases\n\nFacts:\n- J. Paul Boehmer was born on October 30, 1965, and he is an American actor.\n- J. Paul Boehmer is best known for numerous appearances in the Star Trek universe.\n- The Thomas Crown Affair is a 1999 American heist film directed by John McTiernan.\n- The 1999 film The Thomas Crown Affair stars Pierce Brosnan, Rene Russo, and Denis Leary.\n- The 1999 film The Thomas Crown Affair is a remake of the 1968 film of the same name.\n- J. Paul Boehmer also appeared in The Thomas Crown Affair and The Good German.\n- An audiobook version of Gregor and the Code of Claw was released in 2008 and was read by Paul Boehmer.",
